This Pack is computing diagnostics from DSSAT Climate and manegemnet Scenarios simulations
- climate-crop scenarios diagnostics
    - climate drivers correlations to Harvest for any management scenario (any planting date, fertilization level, eagion, climate scenario)
    - differences in correlations for two climate scenarios / two management scenarios (sowing)/ two managemet scenarios (fertilization)

- climate- crop - management - scenarios diagnostics: as a function of the the climate and management  
    - compute EFI (efficiency of fertilization 
     - compute CDI
    - compute CDE
